sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Device A
    participant B as Device B

    Note over A,B: 1. Discovery. Both call start and generate a random nonce
    A->>A: advertise serviceUUID plus nonceA, and scan
    B->>B: advertise serviceUUID plus nonceB, and scan
    A-->>B: advertisement carrying nonceA
    B-->>A: advertisement carrying nonceB

    Note over A,B: 2. Role resolution. Higher nonce becomes central. Assume nonceA is greater
    A->>A: role central, stop scanning
    B->>B: role peripheral, keep advertising

    Note over A,B: 3. Connect and discover GATT
    A->>B: BLE connect
    A->>B: discover services and characteristics

    Note over A,B: 4. Handshake over the handshake characteristic
    A->>B: write publicKeyA plus discoveryTokenA
    B-->>A: read publicKeyB plus discoveryTokenB
    Note over A,B: Both derive a shared key via ECDH

    Note over A,B: 5. Proximity gate over UWB
    A->>A: run NISession with peerToken tokenB
    B->>B: run NISession with peerToken tokenA
    B-->>A: didUpdate distance
    A-->>B: didUpdate distance
    Note over A,B: Proceed only when distance is below the threshold

    Note over A,B: 6. Encrypted payload transfer, chunked to fit the MTU
    A->>B: write cardA frames on payload characteristic
    B-->>A: notify cardB frames on payload characteristic
    A->>B: control done
    B-->>A: control done

    Note over A,B: 7. Reassemble and verify, emit received event
    A->>A: state completed
    B->>B: state completed
